# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore — lrRNA-seq normalization benchmark
#
# Versioning policy:
#   - KEEP: scripts (.Rmd/.py/.sh), manifests (.fofn), small analysis
#           summary CSVs/TSVs, PNGs, and lightweight configs.
#   - EXCLUDE: non-PNG plot outputs (.tiff/.svg/.pdf), R session
#              artifacts, and the large analysis data that is hosted
#              externally (see README.md for how to fetch it).
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- Plot outputs: keep only PNG in the repo ----
*.tiff
*.svg
*.pdf

# ---- R session / editor artifacts ----
.Rhistory
*.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user

# ---- Large analysis data (hosted externally on Zenodo; see README) ----
# All UJC data (fofn manifests + summary tables) and the per-sample
# metagene coverage profiles, plus their zip archives, are external.
Section1/data/UJC/
Section1/data/UJC.zip
Section1/data/metagene_coverage/metagenes_transcripts/
Section1/data/metagene_coverage/metagenes_transcripts.zip
